{"ts": "2026-07-05T19:41:13+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "9ead79a772e1ba7ac18427c89a2b5fdd", "span_id": "edeabdfdae7846f7", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "8ABB127D", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': '209a5a7ab', 'response': 'The pricing details for **Al Noor Trading LLC (CUST001)** are as follows. The customer currently holds an internal credit rating of **BBB**.\\n\\n### Pricing Details by Deal\\n\\n| Deal ID | Product Name | Recommended Price (%) | Funding Cost / Base Rate (%) | Expected Margin (%) | Internal Rating | Outcome |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **DEAL033** | Trade Finance LC | 6.85% | 5.40% | 1.05% | BBB | Won |\\n| **DEAL040** | Corporate Deposit | 5.50% | 5.05% | -0.50% | BBB | Lost |\\n| **DEAL041** | Trade Finance LC | 6.70% | 5.25% | 0.90% | BBB | Won |'}]}"}
